      "designer": "Mirela Belova, Stan Partalev",
      "description": "Inspired by the raw typography of ancient Roman coinage, Thorn Serif captures historic craftsmanship in a versatile design. Created by Type Forward, it features rugged \"carved\" serifs, minimal stroke contrast, compact ascenders, and a high x-height.\n\nThe family spans 8 weights-from a crisp Hairline to a monolithic Black-available as standalone styles or a single variable font file. With rich OpenType features, broad language support, and carefully tuned spacing, Thorn Serif balances ancient heritage with modern digital precision. It is built to deliver a powerful, timeless aesthetic for editorial, branding, and display design.",
